⚠️ 1. JPEG_SCALE_AUTO = -1 (still risky)

You kept:

JPEG_SCALE_AUTO = -1
❌ Problem

This can silently break if somewhere you do:

1 << scale

because:

1 << -1   // undefined behavior

Even if you don’t do it, future maintainers might.

✅ Fix (strong recommendation)
JPEG_SCALE_AUTO = 255

or:

JPEG_SCALE_AUTO = 0xFF
💡 Why this is better
stays unsigned-safe
cannot accidentally be used in bit ops
common embedded pattern
