jpeg_roi_t roi_scaled;

Doc says:

decoded ROI in scaled pixel space

Problem

User confusion:

“scaled from original?”
“LCD space?”
“JPEG space?”
✅ Better name
jpeg_roi_t roi_output;

or

jpeg_roi_t roi_out;
Why

Matches:

